Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find infinity for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fight for this blue sea and\Nlet the wind take us far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can come back to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.02,0:00:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can be present right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw away this drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something you share.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be so afraid to podcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,To have a friend right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will always be here by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the darkest of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.38,0:00:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look and breathe it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the ones who\Nare meant to move in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move to our single horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find insanity for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a world for our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We will win for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We will fight however we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to be the best we will run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To the top, to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta be the ones that\Njust keep dreaming on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never stop cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.86,0:01:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta give everything I got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Become the greatest of all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find infinite fortunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We will step up and we\Nwill leave for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So keep moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:01:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme my soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Olin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's dangerous even without her memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this Tower old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to keep your\Ndistance from her old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna get up, lizard boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me, you hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.12,0:03:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.58,0:03:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.62,0:03:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,red...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,bean... soap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,long enough for my tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, fuck it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Udon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:04:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The present is falling apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they made it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,is he still alive stay\Nwith us master queen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,hey can you hear me he's\Ncompletely unconscious
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But as bouncy as 1.3 billion!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How did she knock him\Nout in just two hits?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniff, sniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniff, sniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniff, sniff, sniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think that's my Oshiriko I smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked she took\Ndown a titan like queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Her power must be on a whole other level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.44,0:06:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's big mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Report to Commander\NKaido immediately. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The never-opening cell got broken apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was, it's probably dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chained up for years, then\Ncrushed to death. Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll report to Onigashima right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:07:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The aroma of that sweet soup\Nis dancing through the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the plan, Warden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We need some orders here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to make her angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Any word from the commander yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got bad news, Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,None of our snails are able to\Nestablish a connection anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we can't\Ncontact Onigashima, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that the enemy is\Ndistracted by the turmoil out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That Caribou sure is a useful fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll cut off their communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they can't relay any more messages,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll be running around like\Nchickens with their heads cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll have the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, with the way the smells\Nwork here, it'll be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you didn't know, the\NWano smells have a huge weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Their signal strength is pitifully\Nweak, so they use a unique system.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of sending their\Ncommunication straight to each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the snails bounce off a boss snail first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one of these guys in each region.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it gets a message,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it sends it to other regions that\Nwould normally be out of range.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I never really pondered it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's because you're a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the plan stars me in my ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what'll happen if I\Ngobble up Udon's boss snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolute chaos is what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That way they won't be able\Nto relay messages, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding, ding, we have a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for you, I've been making\Ngood use of my time in this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all sorts of things, including\Nwhere that big snail is located.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it will you fool now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sit back, relax,\Nand let me work my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, why don't you go and\Ngather up all the keys, rise old chum?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now, Kawamatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll set you\Nfree, no matter the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.70,0:09:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I found my dear suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What a rich and sweet sandpiller here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe there's\Nso much of it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It was worth coming all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And look. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden, sir, I have really bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She's about to find out that the\Npie has nothing inside of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.09,0:09:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was empty all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pig Mom is notorious for her love of food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen when\Nshe finds out there's no soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will be safe from\Nher unstoppable rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll kill us all where we stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about to become a disaster zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's every man for himself! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Like your lives depend on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell could have\Neaten the entire pod?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom seems really\Nbummed out, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really blame her, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I would kill for another\Ncouple bowls myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That soup sure was tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.02,0:11:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who ate it! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everybody looking at me all weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.82,0:11:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you even hear yourself just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You just admitted that you ate the soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I said that out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It was pretty yummy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you made me say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the harm has already been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.18,0:11:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy Toto,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally find Luffy, and he's made\Nhimself the center of trouble, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did I hear you correctly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the man who ate\Nall the red bean soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.24,0:12:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet scent is all over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If we leave the ring, our heads pop off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a chance to\Nwork this out, Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I keep hearing that stupid name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That person is not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a rotten soup\Nstealer. What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She probably doesn't realize it's me\Nbecause of my samurai disguise, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is anything like her\Nlast food fit, it won't end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, really, really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beeping at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If she pushes us back\Nany further, we're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot back down even a single step!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so big, I could have shared it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That poor little town!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank them for being nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:13:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Oshiroko.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try it, Olin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to repay them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They had so little, but they\Ngave me a stranger so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.90,0:14:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wanted to bring them some\Nof that yummy red bean soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You took the joy away\Nfrom those poor people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Those aren't hunger pangs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Compassion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.12,0:14:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's literally going to\Nkill us all with kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't leave a drop
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta try!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They took him off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The colors are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,See that, old man? I got\Nhim! They're off! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's run, old\Nman! Wait, Mr. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.04,0:16:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect me from Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking crazy! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The midst of danger is\Nwhen true power blooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you want me to train right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I mess this up, then\Nyou're probably gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.72,0:16:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am quite aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! You're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just have to do what\NRayleigh did back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to remove your collar now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, now hold on! Are you crazy? You\Ncan't! It'll explode! Yeah, it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've seen it happen before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll hurt her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.02,0:17:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Very bad idea! Stop him! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He set it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do? You.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,GAMING!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.20,0:18:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to do it, but\NI still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd I manage to pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.82,0:18:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I did it without thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even remember\Nwhat I did differently
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This time you're not getting away
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.64,0:18:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat that was an incredible\NRyu-O technique you exhibited
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,quite truthfully It's far\Nsuperior to what I can teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you have the\Npotential to stop her
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.62,0:18:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,deflect that woman's\Npreposterously powerful fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:19:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that you can save our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.18,0:19:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I know you can go\Nand prove me right—do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, and I'm ready—fine, then it\Nappears that he's trying to catch your.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,catch your Can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy. He'll deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta loosen up, right? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My Haki floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.52,0:19:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.26,0:19:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:20:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you think that would blow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.48,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I screwed it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.80,0:20:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I used Barrel to shoot\Nus both just in case. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive after all of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, I have one\Nfinal thing to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about the application of real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You see Haki as you call\Nit coats your outside
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it can be used as armor\Nand also as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,However, when you push that\Npower beyond its limits,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,your Haki doesn't simply fortify\Nyour strength within a focus;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it can penetrate the enemy's body itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,effectively destroying\Nthem from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have already harnessed this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,ability once those steel collars
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,were destroyed from within—that\Nwas the power of your Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.28,0:21:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've proven that you have\Nthe potential within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Man the power you've been working so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.74,0:21:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,to master has been\Ninside of you all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,alone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.22,0:21:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You just didn't realize it was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in that power and use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.66,0:22:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.54,0:22:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You have some nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.22,0:22:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,of eating that entire\Npot of red bean soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.96,0:23:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make you say...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.60,0:23:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Mr. Sriant!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.72,0:23:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.76,0:23:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.74,0:23:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no connection, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.88,0:23:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.79,0:23:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the boss snail\Nvanished into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that rumbling?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.48,0:24:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Pitfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.92,0:24:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Pitfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.26,0:24:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, that blast must have\Nbeen the furnace in the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.26,0:24:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironworks exploded!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.22,0:24:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.64,0:24:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take her on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.82,0:24:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.34,0:24:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.25,0:24:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no chance against\Na monster like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.52,0:24:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She managed to completely\Ndestroy Master Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.62,0:24:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you're OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.70,0:24:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That old bat's acting\Nlike she owns this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.24,0:24:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm going to show her what happens\Nwhen you move in on Kaido's turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.08,0:25:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop running, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.06,0:25:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But we only get one shot, so listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.12,0:25:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only delaying the inevitable!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.24,0:25:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, Big Mom is running\Naround like a wild boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.68,0:25:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,she's gonna charge straight\Nthrough udon and loop back
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.14,0:25:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,around to us you follow set a trap\Nright Right here! Huh? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.14,0:26:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.34,0:26:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.25,0:26:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything has been set in place!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.80,0:26:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here she comes right now, Master Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.82,0:26:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, she just won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.68,0:27:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.54,0:27:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my red bean cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.24,0:27:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,First floor after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.24,0:27:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.44,0:27:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.24,0:27:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.24,0:27:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.90,0:27:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.28,0:27:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear it wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.10,0:27:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.24,0:28:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.72,0:28:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lighten the dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.14,0:28:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.74,0:28:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You really showed her who's boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.00,0:28:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody messes with Master Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.06,0:28:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He just saved the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.02,0:28:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.72,0:28:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.06,0:28:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are my sweet darling babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.62,0:28:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is throbbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.00,0:28:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what was I doing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.74,0:28:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.06,0:28:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We were on our way to the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.02,0:28:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell into the sea and was\Nseparated from my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.86,0:28:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It was right after that\Ndamn king interfered.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.42,0:28:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I recall washing up on the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.80,0:29:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a dingy little town I\Nvisited, and they served me food.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.90,0:29:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshiruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.08,0:29:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou no teacher to screw\Nwith a lead reformer!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.86,0:29:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you were a world-class\Npain in my ass back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.54,0:29:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope it was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.10,0:29:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now eat dirt, witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.32,0:29:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Moshiro-ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.70,0:29:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better get out of here\Nwhile we still can, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.70,0:29:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't quite understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.46,0:29:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. I'll see you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.18,0:29:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That should have knocked her out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.66,0:29:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.86,0:29:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.77,0:29:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of Kaido's minions, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.60,0:29:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.42,0:29:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.70,0:29:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not sticking around to\Nfind out what she can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.96,0:29:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have one more chance to answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.10,0:30:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.14,0:30:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Oshinu call!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.28,0:30:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand that over! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.70,0:30:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry, so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.12,0:30:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.12,0:30:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.60,0:30:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.12,0:30:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.80,0:30:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.14,0:30:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.04,0:30:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out the 100 % sea prism\Nstone cuffs and chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.58,0:30:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to lock her up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.98,0:30:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.14,0:31:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrapping around her a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.78,0:31:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.48,0:31:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's bound, sir! More! More!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.22,0:31:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's enough to hold her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.08,0:31:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be safe until\Nyou double those chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.74,0:31:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me all the animal sedatives\Nyou can scrounge up in pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.82,0:31:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives are on the line, you morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.26,0:31:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You! Look alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.00,0:31:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my ship ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.30,0:31:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.80,0:31:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to evacuate and leave\Nonly the bare minimum of staff!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.78,0:31:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody else, get on board right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.60,0:31:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Baba Nico, I'm leaving all of Udon\Nunder your control, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.52,0:31:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.94,0:31:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That old bat completely demolished\Nevery damn door in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.16,0:31:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So listen, as soon as I'm gone, use the\Nemergency gates to put Udon in Loguetown.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.46,0:31:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw all the prisoners into their cells\Nand get these grounds back in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.14,0:31:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, but I am\Nconcerned about one thing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.02,0:31:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.58,0:32:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Haul ass and don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.08,0:32:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking the old hack straight\Nto Commander Kaito's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.12,0:32:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.80,0:32:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.78,0:32:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.66,0:32:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way to Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.32,0:32:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.23,0:32:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.15,0:32:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate's closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish we could help, but we promised\Nthem we would await their return here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.08,0:32:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We must have faith in\Nthem and stand our ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.84,0:32:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.92,0:32:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we on complete Loguetown yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.60,0:32:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And is our connection restored?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.44,0:32:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't have communications, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.76,0:32:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it seems that\NUdon is completely isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.02,0:32:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no way to exchange\Nmessages with the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.08,0:32:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.36,0:32:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.27,0:32:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.98,0:33:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad Big Mom and Balloon left, or\NI could have used him to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.26,0:33:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you guys will have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.56,0:33:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.92,0:33:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That little pain in the ass is still free.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.70,0:33:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.66,0:33:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always been free.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.48,0:33:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like any other prisoner here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.96,0:33:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.50,0:33:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.88,0:33:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This prison's mine now!
